    <metadataObject ID="standAloneProductInformation" category="DMD" classification="DESCRIPTION">
      <metadataWrap mimeType="text/xml" textInfo="Stand Alone Product Information" vocabularyName="SAFE">
        <xmlData>
          <s1auxsar:standAloneProductInformation>
            <s1auxsar:auxProductType>AUX_PP1</s1auxsar:auxProductType>
            <s1auxsar:validity>2025-04-27T00:00:00.000000</s1auxsar:validity>
            <s1auxsar:generation>2026-02-03T15:21:41.000000</s1auxsar:generation>
            <s1auxsar:instrumentConfigurationId>5</s1auxsar:instrumentConfigurationId>
            <s1auxsar:changeDescription><![CDATA[Description

Update of S1C AUX_PP1, to be used on the top of the AUX_CAL taking into account Antenna pattern predicted considering antenna TRM failures (tile #14: TRM#3 and TRM#4) in order to:

  compensate for Beam to Beam offsets observed on Rain Forest Gamma profile.
  adjust IW VV/VH/HH processing gains in order to get 0dB radiometric bias over Transponders/Corner Reflectors . 
  adjust IW HV and EW DH/DV processing gains in order to align the gamma profiles over RainForest on IW DV used as radiometric reference.
  SM and WV gains are adjusted to get same radiometric performances,as previously.

Reference

RDBADF-256]]></s1auxsar:changeDescription>
          </s1auxsar:standAloneProductInformation>
        </xmlData>
      </metadataWrap>
    </metadataObject>
